["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/hazard", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Hazards are potential sources of harm, danger, or adverse effects to people, property, the environment, or systems within or related to a specific piece of hardware.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
